#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "**Scheduler and Timer Fixes**\n"
#~ "**Scheduled Recordings**\n"
#~ "- Day selection is now available in single-recording mode as well as "
#~ "recurring mode. Selecting multiple days creates a separate scheduled "
#~ "entry for each day, with each entry automatically placed on the next "
